BHAI KE GHAM MEIN SHAH KI KAMAR KI TOOTH GAYI HAI<br>
<br>
 ZAINAB KE QALB-O-CHAAK SE EK HOOK UTTHI HAI,<br>
 MASOOM SAKINA PA QAYAMAT KI GHADI HAI,<br>
 EHLE HARAM MEIN MATA-E-ABBAS-E-ALI HAI,<br>
 SEHRAYE KARBALA MEINYAHI NOUHA GARI HAI<br>
<br>
ABBAS KHAIMA GAH MEIN PAANI NA LAASAKE,<br>
 BACHCHAY HAI INTEZAAR MEIN KUZEY LIYE HUVE,<br>
 KAISE KAHAIN HUSSAIN SAKINA KE SAAMNE,<br>
 ABBAS TASHNALAB LABEY DARIYA GUZAR GAYE<br>
<br>
MASHK-O-ALAM KO LAAYE HAIN JO QAIMA GAAH MEIN,<br>
 ALAM EK IZTERAAB KA HAI QALB-E-SHAH MEIN,<br>
 KYA DARD-E-DIL NEHAA HAI SAKINA KI AAH MEIN,<br>
 SHAAM-E-GARIBAA PHIRTI HAI SHAH KI NIGAAH MEIN<br>
<br>
KUCH DUM MEIN HOGI SEENAYE SHABBIR PAR SINA,<br>
 BARCHI JIGAR PA KHAKE SIDHARE GA NAUJAWAN,<br>
 AB HURMULA HAI TEER HAI AUR HALQ-E-BEZABAAN,<br>
 HO JAYEGI ASEER NABI KI NAWASIYAAN<br>
<br>
WO WAQT HAI KAREEB KE JALNE LAGE GA BAN,<br>
 MAQTAL MEIN HONGEY LAASHEY SHAHDAO KE BE KAFAN,<br>
 DAST-E-SITAM SE TADPEGI BINTE SHAH-E-ZAMAN,<br>
 ZAINAB KE BAZUAOPA BANDHI JAYEGI RASAN<br>
<br>
ZAINAB JIGAR FIGAAR KI CHADAR KI KHAIR HO,<br>
 YARAB SAKINA BIBI KE GOUHAR KI KHAIR HO,<br>
 BEEMAAR NATAWAN KE BISTAR KI KHAIR HO,<br>
 GHURBAT MEIN FATIMA KE BHARE GHAR KI KHAIR HO<br>
<br>
PYASI SAKINA REH GAYI SAQQA NAHI RAHA,<br>
 SAQQEY KE GHAM MEIN HOTA HAI PAANI FURAAT KA,<br>
 JUNGLE MEIN LUT RAHA HAI GULISTAAN-E-FATIMA,<br>
 SAR PEET TI HAI KHAAQ UDATI HAI KARBALA <br>
<br>
DARBAAN-E-SHAAM MEIN MERA CHOUTHA IMAAM HAI,<br>
 AUR SAR BAREHNA ZAINAB-E-AALI MUQAAM HAI,<br>
 IN MANZILAO MEIN SABR TO ABID KA KAAM HAI,<br>
 ABBAS KI JUDAI QAYAMAT KA NAAM HAI<br>
